          {
            "title": "Example: Order",
            "id": 90599,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Скопируй значение <code>num</code>, перебирая каждый <code>num</code> в <code>numbers</code>, только если оно содержит <code>\"+44\"</code> ровно один раз.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"numbers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;+43 5753335&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+44 0051239&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+33 1218817&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"uk_numbers = [num \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(uk_numbers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+44&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['+44 0051239']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>[</code>, затем <code>num</code>, а затем <code>for num in numbers</code>, <code>if</code>, <code>num.count(\"+44\") == 1</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Копируй каждый <code>num</code> из <code>numbers</code>, только если он содержит <code>\"+44\"</code> ровно один раз.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"numbers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;+43 5753335&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+44 0051239&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+33 1218817&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"uk_numbers = [num \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(uk_numbers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+44&quot;) == 0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num.count(&quot;+43&quot;) == 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"numbers\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['+44 0051239']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>[</code>, затем <code>num</code>, <code>for num in numbers</code>, <code>if</code>, <code>num.count(\"+44\") == 1</code>, и наконец <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
